    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκᾰ-πλόος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκᾰ-πλοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκαπλάσιος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.83
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γνωσθὲν ἀποτίνεται δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					54.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Dem.Fr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>: also in fem. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτεισάτω δεκαπλόαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).1421.13
				</span></i>
			 (Cyparissia, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>).</div>
